# src/ — ROS2 workspace source packages
#
# ROS2 packages (ecza_teleop, ecza_kinematics, etc.) will be placed here as
# features 001–005 are implemented.
#
# The Dockerfile COPY src/ src/ requires at least one file so the layer is
# not a no-op. This placeholder serves that purpose and documents the intent.
#
# rosdep install --from-paths src will skip this directory because it contains
# no package.xml files (--ignore-src handles missing packages gracefully).
